// ImageProcessing block's brightness/contrast/flipSign) -> native binding
// 14*3+2 = 44. .x = brightness, .y = contrast, .z = flipSign (0/1); .w reserved.
// Applied as a FINAL affine in the ENCODED (display) color space AFTER the
